**Q5 rationale:** Leverage classification determines income ceiling. CODE/MEDIA scale without marginal labor cost (build once, sell N times). LABOR scales linearly with founder hours — it IS a job regardless of revenue level. HYBRID acknowledges legitimate bootstrap paths (labor → code/media transition).

